  <main class="mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <img src="/img/beever_logo_black.png" alt="Beever" class="h-16 w-auto" />

    <h1 class="mt-8 max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl text-tinta sm:text-5xl">
      Educação financeira que parece brincadeira
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg text-tinta-suave">
      Beever ensina crianças e adolescentes a cuidar do próprio dinheiro através de
      jogos, missões e recompensas — no ritmo de cada um.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a
        href="/cadastro"
        class="flex-1 rounded-favo bg-mel px-6 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-tinta transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-nectar active:translate-y-0 active:bg-ambar focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-ambar focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tinta"
      >
        Criar conta
      </a>
      <a
        href="/login"
        class="flex-1 rounded-favo border border-linha bg-white px-6 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-tinta transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-cera focus-visible:outline-[3px] focus-visible:outline-ambar focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-tinta"
      >
        Já tenho conta
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
